<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Frontier said cut by Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Frontier said cut by Lehman.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Frontier Corp was cut to outperform from buy on Monday by Lehman, according to analyst Blake Bath's office.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 26-3/8 on Friday.  </p>
<p>The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
